{"output":"I’ll inspect the search code and test setup, add a minimal stale-request guard, then run the existing tests without changing them or installing dependencies.\n\nThe controller lets every completed request update state, even after a newer search or clear. I’ll add a request counter and guard results, errors, and loading updates against it, preserving the API and existing results while a new search loads.\n\nFixed src/search/controller.ts with a request counter. Only the latest search can update results, errors, or loading. Clearing immediately resets state and invalidates pending requests.\n\nPublic API and normal behavior preserved. Tests unchanged; no dependencies installed.\n\nVerification: npm test passed all 4 tests; git diff --check passed. Additional inline race checks passed (exit 0).","final_output":"Fixed src/search/controller.ts with a request counter. Only the latest search can update results, errors, or loading. Clearing immediately resets state and invalidates pending requests.\n\nPublic API and normal behavior preserved. Tests unchanged; no dependencies installed.\n\nVerification: npm test passed all 4 tests; git diff --check passed. Additional inline race checks passed (exit 0).","exit_code":0,"model":"gpt-6-astra","session_id":"","steps":14,"tool_calls":[{"name":"shell","status":"success","command_result":{"kind":"command","command":"pwd; git status --short; ls -a","cwd":"/private/tmp/handwork-efficiency-m_m99ddq/2-2-baseline/repo","exit_code":0,"signal":null,"timed_out":false,"duration_ms":197,"stdout_bytes":134,"stderr_bytes":42,"truncated":false,"output_file":"handwork-command-replay-4ed41abf749b17f554af2e104a6b066a.bin","stdout_file":null,"stderr_file":null}},{"name":"glob_files","status":"success"},{"name":"read_file","status":"success"},{"name":"read_file","status":"success"},{"name":"grep_files","status":"success"},{"name":"read_file","status":"success"},{"name":"read_file","status":"success"},{"name":"read_file","status":"success"},{"name":"read_file","status":"success"},{"name":"edit_file","status":"success"},{"name":"edit_file","status":"success"},{"name":"edit_file","status":"success"},{"name":"shell","status":"success","command_result":{"kind":"command","command":"npm test; git diff --check; git diff --stat","cwd":"/private/tmp/handwork-efficiency-m_m99ddq/2-2-baseline/repo","exit_code":0,"signal":null,"timed_out":false,"duration_ms":304,"stdout_bytes":520,"stderr_bytes":0,"truncated":false,"output_file":"handwork-command-replay-f75906cea0b69d511aae913d9cb416bf.bin","stdout_file":null,"stderr_file":null}},{"name":"shell","status":"success","command_result":{"kind":"command","command":"node --input-type=module <<'JS'\nimport assert from 'node:assert/strict';\nimport { createSearchController } from './src/search/controller.ts';\nconst item = title => [{ id: title, title, url: '/' }];\nfor (const outcome of ['resolve', 'reject']) {\n  for (const clear of [false, true]) {\n    const pending = [];\n    const c = createSearchController({ search: () => new Promise((resolve, reject) => pending.push({ resolve, reject })) });\n    const old = c.search('old');\n    const current = c.search('current');\n    if (clear) await c.search('  ');\n    const expected = c.getState();\n    pending[0][outcome](outcome === 'resolve' ? item('old') : new Error('old error'));\n    await old;\n    assert.deepEqual(c.getState(), expected);\n    pending[1].resolve(item('current'));\n    await current;\n    assert.deepEqual(c.getState(), clear\n      ? { query: '', results: [], loading: false, error: null }\n      : { query: 'current', results: item('current'), loading: false, error: null });\n  }\n}\nconst pending = [];\nconst c = createSearchController({ search: () => new Promise(resolve => pending.push(resolve)) });\nconst old = c.search('same');\nconst current = c.search('same');\npending[1](item('latest'));\nawait current;\npending[0](item('stale'));\nawait old;\nassert.deepEqual(c.getState().results, item('latest'));\nconsole.log('Race checks passed: stale success/failure, clear during requests, reverse completion, repeated query.');\nJS","cwd":"/private/tmp/handwork-efficiency-m_m99ddq/2-2-baseline/repo","exit_code":0,"signal":null,"timed_out":false,"duration_ms":76,"stdout_bytes":102,"stderr_bytes":0,"truncated":false,"output_file":"handwork-command-replay-9b12fcb98424f2c2061ae5bbed7defa4.bin","stdout_file":null,"stderr_file":null}}],"usage":{"input_tokens":75092,"output_tokens":1136}}
